@startuml
title State diagram for Green Rides

[*] --> LoginAndSelectDestination : User logs in and selects destination

state "LoginAndSelectDestination" as InitialState

state "ViewJourneyDetails"
ViewJourneyDetails : entry / Display journey details
ViewJourneyDetails : do / Allow user to activate driving mode or choose other options

state "DrivingModeActive"

state "ChoosePlaceToEat"
ChoosePlaceToEat : entry / User selects a place to eat
ChoosePlaceToEat : do / View menu and place order if hungry

state "AccidentDetected" as AccidentState
AccidentState : entry / Inform relevant authorities

state "SendingNotifications"

state "FeedbackProvided" as FinalState

InitialState --> ViewJourneyDetails : View journey details
ViewJourneyDetails --> DrivingModeActive : Activate driving mode
DrivingModeActive --> SendingNotifications : Send notifications during driving
DrivingModeActive --> AccidentState : Accident detected
AccidentState --> SendingNotifications : Inform authorities and send notifications
SendingNotifications --> FeedbackProvided : Provide feedback after journey

FeedbackProvided --> [*]

@enduml
